---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Integrations - CloudDroid" description="CloudDroid integrations with CI/CD platforms, testing frameworks, and developer tools.">
  <div class="bg-slate-light py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Integrations</h1>
      <p class="text-slate text-lg">Connect CloudDroid to your CI/CD pipeline and developer workflow.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">CI/CD Platforms</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">GitHub Actions</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate mb-3">Trigger instance actions, upload artifacts, and run automated tests directly from your GitHub workflows.</p>
            <code class="block bg-navy text-slate-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs">uses: clouddroid/action@v1</code>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">GitLab CI</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate mb-3">Integrate CloudDroid into your GitLab pipelines for automated mobile testing and QA workflows.</p>
            <code class="block bg-navy text-slate-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs">image: clouddroid/ci:latest</code>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Jenkins</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate mb-3">Use the CloudDroid plugin to provision instances, execute tests, and collect results in Jenkins.</p>
            <code class="block bg-navy text-slate-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs">clouddroidPlugin('instance-id')</code>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">CircleCI</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate mb-3">Add CloudDroid as an executor or remote service in your CircleCI config for mobile test jobs.</p>
            <code class="block bg-navy text-slate-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs">executors: clouddroid/instance</code>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Testing Frameworks</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Appium</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">Connect Appium tests directly to CloudDroid instances via ADB over the network.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Espresso</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">Run Espresso instrumented tests on CloudDroid instances with Firebase Test Lab compatibility.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Detox</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">Execute Detox end-to-end tests on CloudDroid instances with built-in device management.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-1">Custom ADB Scripts</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">Use standard ADB commands over TCP to integrate any custom testing framework.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">API Access</h2>
        <p class="text-slate mb-4">All instance actions, metrics, and audit data are available through the REST API. See <a href="/api-docs" class="text-navy underline">API Docs</a> for endpoints and examples.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Need a Custom Integration?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate">Contact <a href="mailto:support@clouddroid.eu" class="text-navy underline">support@clouddroid.eu</a> for custom integration support.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
